    <!-- ═══════════ 主题无关：圆角与尺度 ═══════════ -->

    <!-- 纸片圆角：比 WinUI 默认的 4 略大，边缘更"软"一点 -->
    <CornerRadius x:Key="ControlCornerRadius">8</CornerRadius>
    <CornerRadius x:Key="OverlayCornerRadius">12</CornerRadius>

    <CornerRadius x:Key="PsCardRadius">10</CornerRadius>
    <CornerRadius x:Key="PsBadgeRadius">5</CornerRadius>
    <Thickness x:Key="PsHairline">1</Thickness>

    <!-- 字号阶梯：稿纸上的正文略大于系统默认，便于长台词阅读 -->
    <x:Double x:Key="PsFontSizeSection">15</x:Double>
    <x:Double x:Key="PsFontSizeBody">14</x:Double>
    <x:Double x:Key="PsFontSizeCaption">12</x:Double>
    <x:Double x:Key="PsFontSizeBadge">12</x:Double>

    <!-- 徽章：语义色底 + 纸色字，单字居中 -->
    <x:Double x:Key="PsBadgeSize">22</x:Double>

    <!-- ═══════════ 组件样式 ═══════════ -->

    <!-- 间距阶梯：卡内留白 12、块间 8、行内 6（只定义真正用到的档位，
         不留"备用"令牌——用不到的令牌和写死的数字一样不可维护） -->
    <x:Double x:Key="PsSpaceS">6</x:Double>
    <x:Double x:Key="PsSpaceM">8</x:Double>
    <x:Double x:Key="PsSpaceL">12</x:Double>

    <!-- Padding / Margin 是 Thickness，不能拿上面的 Double 顶替 -->
    <Thickness x:Key="PsPadCard">12</Thickness>
    <Thickness x:Key="PsPadBanner">12,8</Thickness>
    <Thickness x:Key="PsPadStatusBar">14,7</Thickness>
    <Thickness x:Key="PsPadRow">0,3</Thickness>

    <!-- 卡片标题：节点 / 指令 / 属性 -->
    <Style x:Key="PsSectionTitle" TargetType="TextBlock">
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource PsFontSizeSection}" />
        <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{ThemeResource PsInk}" />
    </Style>

    <!-- 次要说明文字：状态栏、流程图提示 -->
    <Style x:Key="PsCaption" TargetType="TextBlock">
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource PsFontSizeCaption}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{ThemeResource PsInkSecondary}" />
        <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap" />
    </Style>

    <!--
      浮起纸片 PsCard：主界面所有卡片的底座，替代原先每处手写的
      Background/BorderBrush/CornerRadius 三件套。

      三层叠出轻拟物的厚度：
        ① 环境影 —— 大而淡，向四周铺开，先让纸离开案垫；
        ② 关键影 —— 贴边 1~3px、略偏下，给出"纸厚 2mm"的错觉；
        ③ 卡面   —— 顶部受光渐变 + 1px 发丝边 + 顶缘一道淡出的高光。
      影子用负 Margin 画到边框之外（Grid 不裁剪子元素），
      因此卡片外观与 Border 一致，只是多了厚度。
    -->
    <Style x:Key="PsCard" TargetType="ContentControl">
        <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
        <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="ContentControl">
                    <Grid>
                        <Border
                            Margin="-4,2,-4,-6"
                            Background="{ThemeResource PsShadowAmbient}"
                            CornerRadius="14"
                            IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                        <Border
                            Margin="-1,2,-1,-3"
                            Background="{ThemeResource PsShadow}"
                            CornerRadius="12"
                            IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                        <Border
                            Background="{ThemeResource PsCardFace}"
                            BorderBrush="{ThemeResource PsEdge}"
                            BorderThickness="{StaticResource PsHairline}"
                            CornerRadius="{StaticResource PsCardRadius}">
                            <Grid>
                                <!-- 顶缘高光：两端淡出，像光从斜上方擦过纸边 -->
                                <Border
                                    Height="1"
                                    Margin="11,1,11,0"
                                    VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                    Background="{ThemeResource PsSheenLine}"
                                    IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                                <ContentPresenter
                                    Margin="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                                    HorizontalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding HorizontalContentAlignment}"
                                    VerticalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding VerticalContentAlignment}"
                                    Content="{TemplateBinding Content}"
                                    ContentTemplate="{TemplateBinding ContentTemplate}" />
                            </Grid>
                        </Border>
                    </Grid>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!--
      下沉井口 PsWell：属性面板的字段区。
      与卡片相反——顶部压暗、底部受光，一眼看出是"凹"进去的；
      里面嵌的输入框聚焦时浮起，形成"井里有纸"的层次。
    -->
    <Style x:Key="PsWell" TargetType="ContentControl">
        <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
        <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="ContentControl">
                    <Border
                        Background="{ThemeResource PsWellFace}"
                        BorderBrush="{ThemeResource PsEdge}"
                        BorderThickness="{StaticResource PsHairline}"
                        CornerRadius="{StaticResource PsCardRadius}">
                        <Grid>
                            <Border
                                Height="7"
                                Margin="1,1,1,0"
                                VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                CornerRadius="9,9,0,0"
                                Background="{ThemeResource PsWellShade}"
                                IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                            <ContentPresenter
                                Margin="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                                HorizontalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding HorizontalContentAlignment}"
                                VerticalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding VerticalContentAlignment}"
                                Content="{TemplateBinding Content}"
                                ContentTemplate="{TemplateBinding ContentTemplate}" />
                        </Grid>
                    </Border>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!--
      工具栏图标钮 PsIconButton：平时是"看不见的方格"，悬停才浮出一层中性底。
      和文字按钮同高 32、无边框——一排图标并排时不会出现一串小方框；
      四个状态都写死在模板里，不依赖框架默认色，深色下也是同一套语汇。
    -->
    <Style x:Key="PsIconButton" TargetType="Button">
        <Setter Property="Width" Value="32" />
        <Setter Property="Height" Value="32" />
        <Setter Property="MinWidth" Value="0" />
        <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="0" />
        <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
        <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="6" />
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
        <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{ThemeResource PsInkSecondary}" />
        <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center" />
        <Setter Property="UseSystemFocusVisuals" Value="True" />
        <Setter Property="FocusVisualMargin" Value="-3" />
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="Button">
                    <Grid
                        x:Name="Root"
                        Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                        CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}">
                        <VisualStateManager.VisualStateGroups>
                            <VisualStateGroup x:Name="CommonStates">
                                <VisualState x:Name="Normal">
                                    <Storyboard>
                                        <ObjectAnimationUsingKeyFrames Storyboard.TargetName="Root" Storyboard.TargetProperty="Background">
                                            <DiscreteObjectKeyFrame KeyTime="0" Value="Transparent" />
                                        </ObjectAnimationUsingKeyFrames>
                                        <ObjectAnimationUsingKeyFrames Storyboard.TargetName="Content" Storyboard.TargetProperty="Foreground">
                                            <DiscreteObjectKeyFrame KeyTime="0" Value="{ThemeResource PsInkSecondary}" />
                                        </ObjectAnimationUsingKeyFrames>
                                        <DoubleAnimation
                                            Storyboard.TargetName="Root"
                                            Storyboard.TargetProperty="Opacity"
                                            To="1"
                                            Duration="0:0:0" />
                                    </Storyboard>
                                </VisualState>
                                <VisualState x:Name="PointerOver">
                                    <Storyboard>
                                        <ObjectAnimationUsingKeyFrames Storyboard.TargetName="Root" Storyboard.TargetProperty="Background">
                                            <DiscreteObjectKeyFrame KeyTime="0" Value="{ThemeResource PsHoverFill}" />
                                        </ObjectAnimationUsingKeyFrames>
                                        <ObjectAnimationUsingKeyFrames Storyboard.TargetName="Content" Storyboard.TargetProperty="Foreground">
                                            <DiscreteObjectKeyFrame KeyTime="0" Value="{ThemeResource PsInk}" />
                                        </ObjectAnimationUsingKeyFrames>
                                        <DoubleAnimation
                                            Storyboard.TargetName="Root"
                                            Storyboard.TargetProperty="Opacity"
                                            To="1"
                                            Duration="0:0:0" />
                                    </Storyboard>
                                </VisualState>
                                <VisualState x:Name="Pressed">
                                    <Storyboard>
                                        <ObjectAnimationUsingKeyFrames Storyboard.TargetName="Root" Storyboard.TargetProperty="Background">
                                            <DiscreteObjectKeyFrame KeyTime="0" Value="{ThemeResource PsPaperSunken}" />
                                        </ObjectAnimationUsingKeyFrames>
                                        <ObjectAnimationUsingKeyFrames Storyboard.TargetName="Content" Storyboard.TargetProperty="Foreground">
                                            <DiscreteObjectKeyFrame KeyTime="0" Value="{ThemeResource PsCinnabarPressed}" />
                                        </ObjectAnimationUsingKeyFrames>
                                        <DoubleAnimation
                                            Storyboard.TargetName="Root"
                                            Storyboard.TargetProperty="Opacity"
                                            To="1"
                                            Duration="0:0:0" />
                                    </Storyboard>
                                </VisualState>
                                <VisualState x:Name="Disabled">
                                    <Storyboard>
                                        <ObjectAnimationUsingKeyFrames Storyboard.TargetName="Root" Storyboard.TargetProperty="Background">
                                            <DiscreteObjectKeyFrame KeyTime="0" Value="Transparent" />
                                        </ObjectAnimationUsingKeyFrames>
                                        <ObjectAnimationUsingKeyFrames Storyboard.TargetName="Content" Storyboard.TargetProperty="Foreground">
                                            <DiscreteObjectKeyFrame KeyTime="0" Value="{ThemeResource PsInkTertiary}" />
                                        </ObjectAnimationUsingKeyFrames>
                                        <DoubleAnimation
                                            Storyboard.TargetName="Root"
                                            Storyboard.TargetProperty="Opacity"
                                            To="0.45"
                                            Duration="0:0:0" />
                                    </Storyboard>
                                </VisualState>
                            </VisualStateGroup>
                        </VisualStateManager.VisualStateGroups>

                        <ContentPresenter
                            x:Name="Content"
                            Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                            HorizontalContentAlignment="Center"
                            VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                            Content="{TemplateBinding Content}"
                            ContentTemplate="{TemplateBinding ContentTemplate}"
                            Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}" />
                    </Grid>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>


    <!-- ═══════════ 列表行模板：两页共用 ═══════════ -->

    <!--
      节点行：左侧一道"书脊"（入口节点为朱砂），像案头立着的索引卡。
    -->
    <DataTemplate x:Key="PsNodeRow">
        <Grid ColumnSpacing="{StaticResource PsSpaceM}" Padding="{StaticResource PsPadRow}">
            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

            <Border
                Grid.Column="0"
                Width="3"
                Height="18"
                CornerRadius="1.5"
                Background="{Binding SpineBrush}" />
            <TextBlock
                Grid.Column="1"
                Text="{Binding Id}"
                FontSize="{StaticResource PsFontSizeBody}"
                VerticalAlignment="Center"
                TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
            <TextBlock
                Grid.Column="2"
                Text="{Binding CountText}"
                FontSize="{StaticResource PsFontSizeCaption}"
                Foreground="{ThemeResource PsInkTertiary}"
                VerticalAlignment="Center" />
        </Grid>
    </DataTemplate>

    <!--
      指令行：语义色单字徽章 + 摘要。徽章颜色与流程图书脊同源，
      扫一眼就能认出这条指令是干什么的。
    -->
    <DataTemplate x:Key="PsInstructionRow">
        <Grid ColumnSpacing="9" Padding="{StaticResource PsPadRow}">
            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

            <Border
                Grid.Column="0"
                Width="{StaticResource PsBadgeSize}"
                Height="{StaticResource PsBadgeSize}"
                CornerRadius="{StaticResource PsBadgeRadius}"
                Background="{Binding KindBrush}">
                <TextBlock
                    Text="{Binding KindGlyph}"
                    FontSize="{StaticResource PsFontSizeBadge}"
                    Foreground="{ThemeResource PsBadgeInk}"
                    HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                    VerticalAlignment="Center" />
            </Border>

            <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                <TextBlock
                    Text="{Binding SummaryText}"
                    FontSize="{StaticResource PsFontSizeBody}"
                    TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                <TextBlock
                    Text="{Binding KindLabel}"
                    FontSize="{StaticResource PsFontSizeCaption}"
                    Foreground="{ThemeResource PsInkTertiary}" />
            </StackPanel>
        </Grid>
    </DataTemplate>

</ResourceDictionary>
